<title>FINLAND: Finnish March jobless rate falls yr/yr to 15.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish March jobless rate falls yr/yr to 15.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish unemployment rate fell 0.7 percentage points year-on-year to 15.9 percent in March, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>March unemployment rose month-on-month by 0.1 percentage points from 15.8 percent in February, SF said.</p>
<p>			  Mar 1997	 Feb 1997	Mar 1996</p>
<p> Unemployed	   397,000	  394,000	 412,000</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)  15.9	     15.8	    16.6</p>
<p>The figures are not seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>Finland's labour ministry, calculating on a different basis, earlier said the March 1997 unemployment rate fell to 17.3 percent from 17.8 percent in February. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
